     {
      "id": 147379,
      "comment": "My favorite machine. This one plays well here at Deep Cuts, I really hope they never take it out of the lineup, it is a signature part of this location. \n\nExtra balls are disabled in mystery mode and you need 13 ramps to light it, so 99% of people who play this will not be achieving an extra ball. \n\nFlippers are nice and strong on this game and sometimes you can hit the ramp shot hard enough it goes past the diverter and you don’t have to plunge bats, castle lock, etc. not sure if this is per design but I’m definitely not complaining \n\nCoffin locks can be a pain to hit on this sometimes \n\nBy far has the worst match percentage out of every game in the lineup \n\n11/10\n\nBlood",
      "location_machine_xref_id": 176765,
      "created_at": "2026-04-16T13:33:42.487-07:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-04-20T18:46:35.166-07:00",
      "user_id": 6930,
      "username": "johnbenede",
      "operator_id": null,
      "admin_title": null,
      "contributor_rank": "Super Mapper",
      "flag": null
     },
     {
      "id": 129229,
      "comment": "Looks and plays great, difficult but not too difficult and a great table to practice nudging and flipper control techniques on. Video mode starts at higher difficulty than normal and extra ball lights at around 20 ramp loops. $1 per play.",
      "location_machine_xref_id": 176765,
